---
// The "these are examples" band above the sponsor wall.
//
// Its own component because it carries the page's most consequential claim: with
// it, sample entries are an honest illustration of a layout; without it, the same
// entries assert partnerships that do not exist. Isolating it means it can be
// captured as its own scenario, so its disappearance shows up as a visible
// change rather than a silent one.
---

<p class="ph-notice">
  <strong>Example placements — not actual sponsors.</strong> The entries below show how
  partners will appear on this page. They will be replaced as real partnerships are
  confirmed.
</p>

<style>
  .ph-notice {
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-lg);
    padding: 14px 16px;
    background: var(--paper-2);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--crimson);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }
  .ph-notice strong {
    color: var(--ink);
  }
</style>
